{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115b","title":"速仆丸与二袁逃辽东","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115b-account","label":"正文","text":"速仆丸等弃部众，与袁尚、袁熙带数千骑逃往辽东。","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0246","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0198","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0221","role":"出奔","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"辽东","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十二年八月","year":207,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o115b-q","wudi-q-o111","wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df"],"chronology":"wudi-y207","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o111","basis":"建安十二年八月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,635,"O115b"],"order":257}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0221","name":"袁熙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0246","name":"速仆丸","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o115b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a17e5b34add834e2d76","layer":"original","quote":"辽东单于速仆丸及辽西、北平诸豪〖15〗，弃其种人〖16〗，与尚、熙奔辽东〖17〗，众尚有数千骑。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":634,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":97,"end":145},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_0